    (property "Note" "Exactly preserve OOB02 channel1 USB priority SELECT=REQUEST&MCU_EN&!EXT with one common authentic G11 DBV gate. OOB02 discharge and external-latch-clear channels are now deleted by the internally latched eFuse/passive-bleed architecture. No dead U771 gate input remains; firmware enumeration restart and retained modem-powered U34 isolation unchanged. Private1329 literal450/200 AON pole d384e3cb-c50d-5f79-b3ff-4f5570c62506 moves28.27um west to45.07,18.6, with only its owned B/In3 stems reterminated and unchanged land/drill. Pole under actual TI DBV0006A primarymaxbody is explicitly Type7 filled/capped planar flat, sealed mask, no proudCopper/meniscus; bothface tent and fill/cap explicit1. Finishedbore .12-.22mm, radialetch26um, relativeCu-bore35um retain54um ring. Factoryjobcondition required; no ordinary SMTbody exception. Whole AONsource/return/PDN and allforeignPADs includingPAD6 require exactnative proof. Private1348 ordinary GND pole42.875,18.0 uses460/150 land/drill outside every actual physicalbody, with shortest .25 B leaf from actualGNDpad2at43.3,18 to pole (length.425mm). This restores the native ground pocket through actual sourced innerGND, allforeignPADs/grownbores/primarybodies checked. Ordinary fillcap2 with bothface tents1. Public finishedbore max230um retains54um ring. No added Type7 groundhole, no body/PAD exemption." (id 5) (at 129.54 50.8 0)
